{"seq":2,"slug":"model-cascades","title":"模型级联与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/methods/model-cascades","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型级联与回退\">模型级联与回退</h1><p>分类器路由要在请求执行前预测难度，而很多请求的真实难点只有答案生成后才暴露。级联换了一种证据顺序：先运行低成本路径，再用结果、验证器或业务约束判断是否接受；证据不足就升级到更强模型或更高 effort。它用更可靠的事后信号换取白跑成本与更长尾延迟。FrugalGPT 的原始研究证明，多模型级联在其特定任务和价格快照上可以显著移动成本—质量前沿；论文中的极高节省是实验条件下的上界，不是生产承诺（<a href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=cSimKw5p6R\">FrugalGPT, TMLR 2024</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-候选序列-接受器与预算\">核心概念：候选序列、接受器与预算</h2><p>一个可执行级联至少包含三部分：按预期成本排列的候选路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_1, P_2, \\dots, P_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，判断当前结果是否足够的接受器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i(x,y_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以及整条请求的预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。候选路径不一定只是不同模型，也可以是「同一模型 + 不同 effort + 不同工具权限」。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>accept at </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{accept at }i \\iff a_i(x,y_i) \\ge \\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accept at </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>escalate only if </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mtext>accept</mtext><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{escalate only if } \\neg\\text{accept} \\land C_{1:i+1} \\le B_c \\land L_{1:i+1} \\le B_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">escalate only if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accept</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是成本上限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是截止时间。只写置信度阈值而不写预算，会让故障流量在级联里无限烧钱或错过用户截止时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[请求 + 预算] --&gt; P1[低成本路径]&#10;  P1 --&gt; A1{质量证据够?}&#10;  A1 --&gt;|是| R1[接受并返回]&#10;  A1 --&gt;|否| B1{成本和时间仍允许?}&#10;  B1 --&gt;|否| D[按风险策略拒绝/降级]&#10;  B1 --&gt;|是| P2[更强模型或更高 effort]&#10;  P2 --&gt; A2{质量证据够?}&#10;  A2 --&gt;|是| R2[接受并返回]&#10;  A2 --&gt;|否| P3[最终权威路径]&#10;  P3 --&gt; R3[返回/人工复核]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[请求 + 预算] --&gt; P1[低成本路径]\n  P1 --&gt; A1{质量证据够?}\n  A1 --&gt;|是| R1[接受并返回]\n  A1 --&gt;|否| B1{成本和时间仍允许?}\n  B1 --&gt;|否| D[按风险策略拒绝/降级]\n  B1 --&gt;|是| P2[更强模型或更高 effort]\n  P2 --&gt; A2{质量证据够?}\n  A2 --&gt;|是| R2[接受并返回]\n  A2 --&gt;|否| P3[最终权威路径]\n  P3 --&gt; R3[返回/人工复核]</pre><p>级联成本必须按「到达概率」计算。若路径成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，到达第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 档的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，接受器与验证器额外成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[C]=\\sum_i r_i(c_i+v_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自真实流量，不是设计文档里的估计。困难请求比例上升、第一档变贵或接受器变保守，都会让前沿快速移动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接受器-不要把流畅当正确\">接受器：不要把流畅当正确</h2><p>接受器是级联的命门。小模型过度自信时，错误结果会在第一档被放行；接受器过度保守时，大量正确答案也会升级，成本与延迟收益消失。不同任务应使用不同证据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>适用任务</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>token 概率/熵</td>\n<td>分类、短答案</td>\n<td>低开销</td>\n<td>流畅不等于正确，跨模型难校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则与 schema 校验</td>\n<td>结构化输出、工具参数</td>\n<td>确定、可解释</td>\n<td>只能证明格式，不能证明语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可执行验证</td>\n<td>代码、SQL、计算</td>\n<td>直接验证关键不变量</td>\n<td>测试覆盖不足仍会漏错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立 judge</td>\n<td>开放式回答</td>\n<td>能覆盖语义</td>\n<td>有偏差且增加调用成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次采样一致性</td>\n<td>可比较的推理答案</td>\n<td>能发现不稳定</td>\n<td>成本成倍增加，同错仍可能一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务结果/人工复核</td>\n<td>高风险决策</td>\n<td>对准真实目标</td>\n<td>延迟高，反馈可能很晚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>校准必须在独立验证集完成，并按风险子集分别看 false accept rate。总准确率看起来很好时，医疗、支付、权限或不可逆工具调用的错误仍可能集中在尾部。高风险路径更适合「失败关闭」：证据不足就升级、拒绝或交人工，而不是为了节省强行接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨模型级联与同模型-effort-级联\">跨模型级联与同模型 effort 级联</h2><p>传统级联在小模型、中模型、旗舰模型之间升级。现在还要把同模型 effort 看成独立候选：低 effort 先处理简单请求，验证失败时以更高 effort 重新执行。当前 OpenAI 与 Claude 接口都提供模型相关的 effort 控制，但支持档位和默认值不同，必须查能力注册表而不是硬编码（<a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/models\">OpenAI Models</a>，<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/effort\">Claude Effort</a>）。</p>\n<p>同模型 effort 级联有三个独特风险。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不保证单调</strong>：更高 effort 通常投入更多计算，但不保证每个样本都更好，必须按任务测量。</li>\n<li><strong>重复生成</strong>：第二档通常无法复用第一档全部计算，成本不是「只补差额」。</li>\n<li><strong>会话与缓存耦合</strong>：例如 Claude 文档明确说明在同一长会话中改变 effort 会影响提示缓存前缀；依赖缓存的系统应在会话开始固定 effort，或把升级视为新的执行分支。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个稳健候选注册表可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"path_id = model_snapshot + effort + tool_protocol + prompt_version&#10;expected_cost = input_price_snapshot + output_price_snapshot + tool_cost&#10;constraints = region + retention + capability + deadline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>path_id = model_snapshot + effort + tool_protocol + prompt_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expected_cost = input_price_snapshot + output_price_snapshot + tool_cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>constraints = region + retention + capability + deadline</span></span></code></pre></div><p>因此「模型没变」不代表实验 arm 没变；effort、工具协议或系统提示变化都要产生新 arm。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量升级与可用性回退是两条状态机\">质量升级与可用性回退是两条状态机</h2><p>质量级联回答「结果够不够好」，可用性回退回答「选中的端点能不能完成请求」。超时、限流和服务故障应先在 provider 层处理；结果通过传输却不满足任务质量，才进入质量升级。把两者混成一个 fallback 列表会产生两类错误：网络故障意外换到能力更弱的模型，或质量失败在同一能力端点间反复重试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Execute&#10;  Execute --&gt; ProviderRetry: timeout/rate limit&#10;  ProviderRetry --&gt; Execute: alternate endpoint&#10;  Execute --&gt; QualityGate: response complete&#10;  QualityGate --&gt; Accept: evidence passes&#10;  QualityGate --&gt; Escalate: evidence fails&#10;  Escalate --&gt; Execute: next capability path&#10;  Accept --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Execute\n  Execute --&gt; ProviderRetry: timeout/rate limit\n  ProviderRetry --&gt; Execute: alternate endpoint\n  Execute --&gt; QualityGate: response complete\n  QualityGate --&gt; Accept: evidence passes\n  QualityGate --&gt; Escalate: evidence fails\n  Escalate --&gt; Execute: next capability path\n  Accept --&gt; [*]</pre><p>每次尝试都要记录 <code>attempt_id</code>、<code>path_id</code>、resolved provider、失败类型和幂等键。工具调用或写操作不能因为质量升级而重复执行；级联只能重放纯推理，副作用必须由执行账本去重或复用已有收据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推测级联-token-段级的特殊分支\">推测级联：token 段级的特殊分支</h2><p>推测级联把回退粒度从整次请求细化到 token 段。小模型先起草，大模型给出参考，策略逐段决定接受草稿还是采用大模型输出。它与经典推测解码不同：经典方案通常以保持目标模型分布为目标，推测级联允许按质量—成本目标接受「足够好」的草稿，因此可能改变输出分布。Google Research 的工作展示了这一混合思路（<a href=\"https://research.google/blog/speculative-cascades-a-hybrid-approach-for-smarter-faster-llm-inference/\">Speculative Cascades, 2025</a>）。</p>\n<p>它适合控制推理栈、词表和批处理调度的团队，不适合把两个远程黑盒 API 简单串起来。网络往返、不同 tokenizer、不可访问 logits 与供应商计费方式，往往会吃掉理论收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线前的失败演练\">上线前的失败演练</h2><p>级联不是把几行 if-else 上线。至少要演练：第一档过度自信、judge 超时、预算服务不可用、模型别名漂移、provider 连续限流、工具副作用已发生但响应丢失，以及最终档也未通过质量门。每种故障都要有终止状态：接受、升级、拒绝、降级输出或人工复核。</p>\n<p>上线门应同时包含：第一档接受率、false accept rate、升级后挽救率、每档到达率、完整成本、p95/p99 延迟、预算耗尽率和重复副作用数。只看平均成本会掩盖尾部用户经历的多次白跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>级联由候选路径、接受器和成本/时间预算共同组成，不是只有一个置信度阈值。</li>\n<li>接受器应优先使用任务可验证证据，并按高风险子集测 false accept rate。</li>\n<li>候选既可以跨模型，也可以在同一模型内升级 effort；effort 语义绑定模型快照且不保证样本级单调。</li>\n<li>provider 可用性回退与质量升级是两条状态机，日志和指标必须分开。</li>\n<li>副作用不能随级联重放，必须以幂等键和执行收据隔离纯推理与真实写操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一节：<a href=\"classifier-routing\">分类器路由</a> —— 在执行前完成选择的对照方案。</li>\n<li>同章下一节：<a href=\"difficulty-estimation\">难度估计</a> —— 接受器信号与校准方法。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/routing-data\">路由数据与标注</a> —— 训练接受器所需的数据。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/routing-in-practice\">落地与权衡</a> —— 级联的发布、预算和降级策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型级联与回退","id":"模型级联与回退"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：候选序列、接受器与预算","id":"核心概念-候选序列-接受器与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"接受器：不要把流畅当正确","id":"接受器-不要把流畅当正确"},{"level":2,"text":"跨模型级联与同模型 effort 级联","id":"跨模型级联与同模型-effort-级联"},{"level":2,"text":"质量升级与可用性回退是两条状态机","id":"质量升级与可用性回退是两条状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"推测级联：token 段级的特殊分支","id":"推测级联-token-段级的特殊分支"},{"level":2,"text":"上线前的失败演练","id":"上线前的失败演练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分类器路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/methods/classifier-routing"},"next":{"title":"难度估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/methods/difficulty-estimation"}}